  "body": "17th floor exceptional views to Rangitoto and the shipping lanes of Auckland its your chance to buy premium realestate in Takapuna for a reasonable price. Owner is downsizing  the portfolio and someone will be a lucky new owner .\r\nOut of the Spencer hotel and currently  rented .\r\nReasonable  body corp fees\r\nSpa,lap pool \r\nTennis courts\r\nFull Gym\r\nClose to public transport and  great Nth shore schools.\r\nFully furnished \r\nViewing and handover  on completion  of tenancy  contract, looking for exspressions of interest. \r\nZero real estate  fees to pay so price will  reflect  this .\r\nREAL ESTATE AGENTS DO NOT CONTACT ME PLEASE.",
